{'symbol': 'PTC', 'date': '2022-02-02 09:00:00', 'title': 'PTC NAMED OVERALL LEADER IN ENTERPRISE AUGMENTED REALITY PLATFORMS ASSESSMENT FROM ABI RESEARCH', 'text': 'BOSTON, FEB. 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PTC\xa0(NASDAQ: PTC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS BEEN NAMED THE OVERALL LEADER IN THE ENTERPRISE AUGMENTED REALITY (AR) PLATFORMS MARKET FOR ITS VUFORIA® ENTERPRISE AR SOLUTION SUITE IN A NEW REPORT FROM ABI RESEARCH ENTITLED, "ENTERPRISE AUGMENTED REALITY PLATFORMS – COMPETITIVE RANKING." THE COMPLETE REPORT CAN BE DOWNLOADED HERE.'}